# WHAT: Git exclusion rules protecting secrets, private notes, build artifacts, and workspace scratch files.
# WHY: Prevents leaking credentials (.env), submitting private Turkish study notes (.notes/),
#      or polluting the clean assessment repository with warmup exercises and binaries.
# EXPECTED OUTPUT EXAMPLE (`git status --short`):
#   ?? CLAUDE.md
#   ?? go.mod
#   # (.env, .notes/, PROMPTS.md, go-warmup/ never appear as untracked/staged files)

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.notes/
coverage.*
bin/
PROMPTS.md
go-warmup/
*.exe
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

